6:["$","div",null,{"className":"prose prose-slate max-w-none dark:prose-invert prose-h2:text-2xl prose-h2:tracking-tight prose-p:leading-8 prose-a:text-blue-700","children":[["$","section","How creators should evaluate AI tools",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"How creators should evaluate AI tools"}],[["$","p","Creators should evaluate AI tools by output quality, workflow fit, review controls, export speed, and whether the tool helps with a repeatable job. A tool that generates ten video hooks is useful only if those hooks match the audience, platform, and publishing cadence.",{"children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"Creators should evaluate AI tools by output quality, workflow fit, review controls, export speed, and whether the tool helps with a repeatable job. A tool that generates ten video hooks is useful only if those hooks match the audience, platform, and publishing cadence."}]]}],["$","p","Focused tools reduce prompt fatigue. Instead of asking a blank chat box to infer format and tone every time, a structured generator can ask for the topic, audience, tone, and desired sections upfront.",{"children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"Focused tools reduce prompt fatigue. Instead of asking a blank chat box to infer format and tone every time, a structured generator can ask for the topic, audience, tone, and desired sections upfront."}]]}]]]}],["$","section","When ToolOrbit is a good fit",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"When ToolOrbit is a good fit"}],[["$","p","ToolOrbit is useful for practical content steps: polish rough text, translate a draft, generate video scripts, create YouTube titles and descriptions, write ecommerce listings, summarize meetings, and draft weekly reports.",{"children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"ToolOrbit is useful for practical content steps: polish rough text, translate a draft, generate video scripts, create YouTube titles and descriptions, write ecommerce listings, summarize meetings, and draft weekly reports."}]]}],["$","p","It also pairs AI output with deterministic tools. After generating copy, creators can clean text, analyze word count, convert images, compress assets, or prepare QR codes without leaving the same tool ecosystem.",{"children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"It also pairs AI output with deterministic tools. After generating copy, creators can clean text, analyze word count, convert images, compress assets, or prepare QR codes without leaving the same tool ecosystem."}]]}]]]}],["$","section","When a general AI assistant is better",{"className":"mb-10","children":[["$","h2",null,{"children":"When a general AI assistant is better"}],[["$","p","Use a general assistant when the work is exploratory: planning a campaign, comparing positioning, synthesizing research, or iterating across many constraints. A blank chat interface is more flexible when the shape of the answer is not known yet.",{"children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"Use a general assistant when the work is exploratory: planning a campaign, comparing positioning, synthesizing research, or iterating across many constraints. A blank chat interface is more flexible when the shape of the answer is not known yet."}]]}],["$","p","Use a focused ToolOrbit utility when the output format is known and speed matters. A YouTube description generator, listing generator, or text polisher can be faster than building a prompt from scratch.",{"children":[["$","$1","0",{"children":"Use a focused ToolOrbit utility when the output format is known and speed matters. A YouTube description generator, listing generator, or text polisher can be faster than building a prompt from scratch."}]]}]]]}],"$Le"]}]
